@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
title Activity Diagram: Online Examination System
|Student|
start
:Log in with enrolment number and password;
|Exam Server|
:Validate credentials;
if (credentials valid?) then (yes)
  :List scheduled exams;
else (no)
  :Show login error;
  stop
endif
|Student|
:Select exam;
|Exam Server|
if (exam available?) then (yes)
  :Create exam attempt;
  :Load question paper and start timer;
else (no)
  :Show exam not available;
  stop
endif
|Student|
repeat
  :Answer current question;
  |Exam Server|
  :Save answer;
  |Student|
repeat while (time left and not submitted?) is (yes) not (no)
|Exam Server|
:Lock attempt;
fork
  :Auto-evaluate objective answers;
fork again
  |Evaluator|
  :Evaluate descriptive answers;
  :Enter marks;
  |Exam Server|
end fork
:Compute total marks;
if (total at least pass marks?) then (yes)
  :Mark result PASS;
else (no)
  :Mark result FAIL;
endif
:Publish result;
|Student|
:View result;
stop
@enduml
